<key>NSCameraUsageDescription</key>
<string>Used to take photos to back up to your photo library.</string>

<key>NSPhotoLibraryUsageDescription</key>
<string>Used to select photos to back up to your photo library.</string>

<key>NSPhotoLibraryAddUsageDescription</key>
<string>Used to save photos back to your device.</string>

